        s("Branded client apps",
          "A branded app puts your name and logo in front of clients every day. Traiv includes your name and logo on the Trainer plan. PT Distinction includes custom-branded iOS and Android apps on Pro and Master. Everfit and TrueCoach include branding on their higher plans. Others sell it as an add-on or not at all. The platform cost calculator shows the branding position for each."),
